{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02369",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.62,
      "end_seconds": 5.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "So, hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.12,
      "end_seconds": 10.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "that's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.05,
      "end_seconds": 17.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "It's, It's itchy red patches that have gone crusty, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.49,
      "end_seconds": 22.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "let me get the readings out of the way"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.96,
      "end_seconds": 38.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.2,
      "end_seconds": 59.73,
      "duration_seconds": 11.53,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 117 over 75, oxygen saturation is 98 percent. And heart rate 77, temperature is 36.7 degrees. Okay, since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.51,
      "end_seconds": 72.99,
      "duration_seconds": 11.48,
      "text": "ever since... since this morning, really i'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me i've never really been one for hospitals"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.76,
      "end_seconds": 82.94,
      "duration_seconds": 9.18,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.36,
      "end_seconds": 97.55,
      "duration_seconds": 13.19,
      "text": "It's, It's every other day. Pretty severe, if I'm being honest. Only emollient, and and it's not much. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.99,
      "end_seconds": 101.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.03,
      "end_seconds": 115.42,
      "duration_seconds": 8.39,
      "text": "It usually comes with being irritable. Let me think, the being irritable? That's been for one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.01,
      "end_seconds": 120.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Any drowsiness, blisters, high fever or eating poorly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.82,
      "end_seconds": 127.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.39,
      "text": "I haven't had drowsiness, blisters, high fever or eating poorly, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.06,
      "end_seconds": 129.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.53,
      "end_seconds": 131.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "nothing odd there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.96,
      "end_seconds": 152.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.43,
      "end_seconds": 156.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "My grandfather had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.31,
      "end_seconds": 166.78,
      "duration_seconds": 8.47,
      "text": "So, are there any allergies I should be aware of? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.3,
      "end_seconds": 171.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.08,
      "end_seconds": 187.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.57,
      "end_seconds": 197.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.99,
      "text": "Right, I had my appendix taken out when I was in my twenties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.61,
      "end_seconds": 202.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.74,
      "end_seconds": 214.7,
      "duration_seconds": 11.96,
      "text": "I have eczema. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.68,
      "end_seconds": 220.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.25,
      "end_seconds": 240.67,
      "duration_seconds": 19.42,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner. I quit smoking around ten years ago. I swim twice a week. I work in accounts at a hospital. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.27,
      "end_seconds": 257.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.63,
      "end_seconds": 266.69,
      "duration_seconds": 8.06,
      "text": "Hydrocortisone cream i take it when needed. A moisturiser i take it twice a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.62,
      "end_seconds": 271.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.47,
      "end_seconds": 274.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.27,
      "end_seconds": 295.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.9,
      "text": "The eczema patches on the arms have yellow crusts and weeping areas."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.04,
      "end_seconds": 334.56,
      "duration_seconds": 33.52,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. Let me tell you where I've got to. It points towards eczema with a bacterial skin infection. We should do a skin swab for infected eczema. I'm prescribing flucloxacillin, 250 milligrams, four times a day, seven days. That's for infected eczema. Keep the nails short and keep using the moisturiser. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.92,
      "end_seconds": 344.81,
      "duration_seconds": 8.89,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department. Book a review in one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.1,
      "end_seconds": 347.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Yes, that's manageable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.75,
      "end_seconds": 355.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.8,
      "end_seconds": 357.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.37,
      "end_seconds": 360.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}